         BACKGROUND — dense two-tier PCB circuit, fully static
         Primary traces + a finer secondary layer of shorter traces
         and via-dots fill the board out. No moving light, no JS, no
         mousemove — just a handful of nodes doing a slow idle pulse
         (plain opacity keyframe, cheap and reliable). Everything
         else is a static vector paint, about as cheap as a
         background image.
    ============================================================ -->
